---
description: Make the SpringBrand Skills visible at the start of every prompt
alwaysApply: true
---

SpringBrand is available through the installed `ask-springbrand` Skill.

It has three capability domains:
- Platform: create and publish artifacts, manage Plugins, and browse the Marketplace
- Action API: use dynamic API services for tasks
- Connector: work with third-party systems such as GitHub

When the right domain is unclear, or the user asks what SpringBrand can do, follow `ask-springbrand` Skill first; it recommends exactly one Domain Skill and stops.

This Notice only makes the Skills visible. It does not determine fit, call MCP, or authorize side effects.
